(6559038, 977234, 73942, '<td valign="top">again, this looks so much better over here than on FB, I hadn''t noticed the land in the distance before, you''ve got great depth, nice detail in the foreground, love that green seaweed and such a wonderful long long exposure of the water and yet you''ve still got great detail in the sand, this should score well, wish I could vote on it</td>', 'again, this looks so much better over here than on FB, I hadn''t noticed the land in the distance before, you''ve got great depth, nice detail in the foreground, love that green seaweed and such a wonderful long long exposure of the water and yet you''ve still got great detail in the sand, this should score well, wish I could vote on it', '2011-10-03 07:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
