(6559071, 977095, 117474, '<td valign="top">I think the contextual scenery is a bit blown probably due to the long exposure. Nice scene. But I''d like to have seen maybe blues in the sky or cloud definition and more details on the grass. Perhaps some light HDR''ing on the image would have given you that while maintaining the motion blur.</td>', 'I think the contextual scenery is a bit blown probably due to the long exposure. Nice scene. But I''d like to have seen maybe blues in the sky or cloud definition and more details on the grass. Perhaps some light HDR''ing on the image would have given you that while maintaining the motion blur.', '2011-10-03 08:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6559073, 977191, 117474, '<td valign="top">Technically wonderful, but to me visually... not too interesting to be honest. <br/>Great capture! <br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Technically wonderful, but to me visually... not too interesting to be honest. Great capture!  7', '2011-10-03 08:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
