(6559149, 977065, 108580, '<td valign="top">:P Snap! Awesome shot, love the prop blur and the near head on angle which has the side effect of the pilot being somewhat obscured. I agonised over the fuselage that was in shadow and how that would be perceived by voters so went with a bit more exposure in that area. Rian? Stephen? I think a lot of voters are going to comment about our 2 aircraft entries and possibly that it was shot at an American Airshow :) Odd that we should both submit the same aircraft out of at least 20 possibles flown that day!</td>', ':P Snap! Awesome shot, love the prop blur and the near head on angle which has the side effect of the pilot being somewhat obscured. I agonised over the fuselage that was in shadow and how that would be perceived by voters so went with a bit more exposure in that area. Rian? Stephen? I think a lot of voters are going to comment about our 2 aircraft entries and possibly that it was shot at an American Airshow :) Odd that we should both submit the same aircraft out of at least 20 possibles flown that day!', '2011-10-03 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6559154, 976930, 108580, '<td valign="top">Super work.</td>', 'Super work.', '2011-10-03 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
