(6563166, 977247, 47470, '<td valign="top">I keep wanting to scroll up in the image to see a bit more of the sky and the mountains on the sides.  The clouds are blown out quite a bit because you exposed for the shady valley.  You could have remedied that by combining two (or more exposures), one for the valley and one for the sky.  I also wish that the water was moving a bit more to create some extra texture in the main part of your image.</td>', 'I keep wanting to scroll up in the image to see a bit more of the sky and the mountains on the sides.  The clouds are blown out quite a bit because you exposed for the shady valley.  You could have remedied that by combining two (or more exposures), one for the valley and one for the sky.  I also wish that the water was moving a bit more to create some extra texture in the main part of your image.', '2011-10-07 09:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563336, 977173, 42181, '<td valign="top">That would be very fast though what looks like the Blackwall Tunnel :-)</td>', 'That would be very fast though what looks like the Blackwall Tunnel :-)', '2011-10-07 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
