(6565842, 976966, 124815, '<td valign="top">How did you do it all, beats me. The skirt looking like an LP is fabulous. <br/>How did I totally ignore to look at this challenge before the end is beyond me. But, better late than never.<br/> <br/>I keep on playing with the location of the steady leg and push the image to the right of the screen. Perhaps with less space on the right it would look even more impressive. <br/> <br/>I love the intensity of the steady leg, the veins, its amazing poise. And the floor without scratches would be a mistake. Great shot.</td>', 'How did you do it all, beats me. The skirt looking like an LP is fabulous. How did I totally ignore to look at this challenge before the end is beyond me. But, better late than never. I keep on playing with the location of the steady leg and push the image to the right of the screen. Perhaps with less space on the right it would look even more impressive.  I love the intensity of the steady leg, the veins, its amazing poise. And the floor without scratches would be a mistake. Great shot.', '2011-10-10 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
