(6566492, 976953, 93565, '<td valign="top">I saw this in voting and was instantly impressed. I''m very happy that it ended up placing as it did, as I feared it would be another of the shots I''m keen of that fails to excite the voters.<br/>I think it''s the vivid colors that really separate this visually. The intensity of the colors with the drab concrete takes a largely dull and dead scene and invigorates it.</td>', 'I saw this in voting and was instantly impressed. I''m very happy that it ended up placing as it did, as I feared it would be another of the shots I''m keen of that fails to excite the voters.I think it''s the vivid colors that really separate this visually. The intensity of the colors with the drab concrete takes a largely dull and dead scene and invigorates it.', '2011-10-11 23:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
