(6567128, 977228, 13759, '<td valign="top">Very amazing picture. Well done and perfectly balanced. The colocasting is very natural and good feel too. I was surprised by the shape you get from the water. I think the secret is to launch as a whole a lot of water. Like using a gate or something to liberate it. I´ll realy apreciate some detais from the making of. Curious...</td>', 'Very amazing picture. Well done and perfectly balanced. The colocasting is very natural and good feel too. I was surprised by the shape you get from the water. I think the secret is to launch as a whole a lot of water. Like using a gate or something to liberate it. I´ll realy apreciate some detais from the making of. Curious...', '2011-10-12 14:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
