(6569685, 976915, 102315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful river scene but definitely over exposed. The trees give away the time of day you shot this. Sun looks to be too harsh bouncing off those trees and across the river. Maybe try a neutral density filter or shoot it in a different time of day for those type shot. Your river flow looks awesome though. Almost like a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful river scene but definitely over exposed. The trees give away the time of day you shot this. Sun looks to be too harsh bouncing off those trees and across the river. Maybe try a neutral density filter or shoot it in a different time of day for those type shot. Your river flow looks awesome though. Almost like a painting.', '2011-10-17 01:46:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6570495, 977021, 18197, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this great great image. It is creative, emotive, and extraordinarily well executed. I''m delighted to see it in the top 10. But I am devastated it didn''t earn the blue.</td>', 'Congratulations on this great great image. It is creative, emotive, and extraordinarily well executed. I''m delighted to see it in the top 10. But I am devastated it didn''t earn the blue.', '2011-10-17 22:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
